## 5. Testable acceptance criteria — summary index

| Phase | Headline test |
|---|---|
| 0 | Full chat turn completes with network blocked; no writes outside app-data dir |
| 1 | 50-turn history survives restart identically; provider swap is non-destructive |
| 2 | Deleted fact disappears from retrieval within one turn; memory-off writes nothing |
| 3 | Voice round-trip works hands-free; no audio on disk unless enabled |
| 4 | Emotions and lip-sync trigger deterministically; within CPU/GPU budget |
| 5 | Unapproved action blocked; approval shows exact target; audit log complete |
| 6 | Fresh install performs zero egress; cloud requires explicit, previewed consent |

